window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A Kitchen Witch with a bite, a King of Hell on a mission, and a candy coated town hiding bitter secrets. </b> <br> <br> Josie Benoit, gourmet patissier and kitchen witch, may not be a Sweet Pea native but she's made the small town her home and she intends on keeping it that way. When trouble rolls into town on the seats of shining motorcycles, and the safety of her home and her own reputation are put at risk, Josie bands together with her coven to protect her world from a dark influence. <br> If only that dark influence wasn't so deliciously handsome. <br> <br> King Beleth is not a demon to be trifled with. <br> Leader of the Hell’s Bells MC and one of the great warlords of the Bowels, Beleth takes pride in his work and has the patience of a… man who knows what is best is worth waiting for. Known as Bell—to his friends, which you are not—he’s come to Sweet Pea to dismantle the core of good at the heart of the little town. But upon arrival he discovers three things that might just get in the way of his work: <br> Sweet Pea is more disgustingly adorable than they were warned. <br> The town has a coven of witches protecting it. <br> He’s developing a sweet tooth.</p>"; 
